--resume and --discard-review allow only --project and --offline
usage: omega update [package-or-alias...] [--to <revision>] [--target <name>]... [--project <dir>] [--offline] [--build-input <path>]... [--optional-build-input <path>]... [--dangerously-accept-all]
       omega update --resume [--project <dir>] [--offline]
       omega update --discard-review [--project <dir>] [--offline]
       omega update --help
--offline disables package source network acquisition for this invocation.
--discard-review abandons pending review; it does not discard publication recovery.
--dangerously-accept-all accepts every pending review decision unread and publishes; omega.lock records each acceptance as if edited by hand.
